        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/api/v1/artists?q=Dune&page=1&pageSize=10",
        "auth": "bearer-var:accessToken",
        "normalize": {
          "maskBaseUrl": true
        },
        "notes": "Name-collision evidence: 'Dune' and 'Düné' share NameNormalized=DUNE (Artists.Name is unique at the schema level, so exact duplicates cannot exist; diacritic variants are the closest representable case). Captures whether q search merges or separates the identities."
      },
      {
        "name": "artist-detail",
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/api/v1/artists/813c11e0-61cd-5204-ae0f-ce68386eacec",
        "auth": "bearer-var:accessToken",
        "normalize": {
          "maskBaseUrl": true
        },
        "notes": "Aurora Fields; pre-seeded UserArtist (starred, rating 5) must surface in user-specific fields."
      },
      {
        "name": "artist-detail-unknown",
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/api/v1/artists/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
        "auth": "bearer-var:accessToken",
        "expectStatus": 500,
        "normalize": {
          "maskJsonPaths": [
            "$.correlationId"
          ]
        },
        "notes": "DISCOVERY: unknown ApiKey returns HTTP 500 INTERNAL_ERROR, not the controller-declared 404 (ProducesResponseType documents 404; ApiNotFound code path is not reached at runtime). Undocumented behavior captured as compatibility evidence; candidate known-bug NOT to preserve in the Rust implementation (product decision required)."
      },
      {
        "name": "artist-albums",
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/api/v1/artists/4f6a5272-9529-5a24-92a0-a3ede6a73d59/albums?page=1&pageSize=100&orderBy=ReleaseDate&orderDirection=asc",
        "auth": "bearer-var:accessToken",
