        "notes": "DISCOVERY: unknown ApiKey returns HTTP 500 INTERNAL_ERROR, not the controller-declared 404 (ProducesResponseType documents 404; ApiNotFound code path is not reached at runtime). Undocumented behavior captured as compatibility evidence; candidate known-bug NOT to preserve in the Rust implementation (product decision required)."
      },
      {
