          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": 400,
        "normalize": {
          "maskJsonPaths": [
            "$.traceId"
          ]
        },
        "notes": "CLIENT/SERVER MISMATCH EVIDENCE: MeloAmp posts an OBJECT body { songIds: [...] } (PlaylistPickerDialog.tsx:91) but the server action binds [FromBody] Guid[] — a bare array — so the object form fails model binding with an ASP.NET validation envelope. MeloAmp add-to-playlist is broken against this baseline; the Rust server must reproduce the 400 for the object shape unless a product decision changes the API. (Since the bare-array form also fails — see add-songs — no working add-songs form exists at this baseline.)"
